1
00:00:04,042 --> 00:00:06,542
This blade has a dark past.

2
00:00:09,942 --> 00:00:12,504
It has shed much innocent blood.

3
00:00:15,942 --> 00:00:18,879
You're a fool for traveling alone,
so completely unprepared.

4
00:00:18,892 --> 00:00:21,104
You're lucky your blood's still flowing.

5
00:00:24,542 --> 00:00:25,267
Thank you.

6
00:00:26,892 --> 00:00:27,517
So...

7
00:00:28,692 --> 00:00:30,992
What brings you to
the land of the gatekeepers?

8
00:00:35,742 --> 00:00:37,154
I'm searching for someone.

9
00:00:37,192 --> 00:00:39,897
Someone very dear?
A kindred spirit?

10
00:00:43,292 --> 00:00:44,204
A dragon.

11
00:00:47,642 --> 00:00:49,767
A dangerous quest for a lone hunter.

12
00:00:53,642 --> 00:00:56,554
I've been alone for
as long as I can remember.

